# National Humanities Faculty Working Papers. Readings and References in the Humanities.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This National Humanities Faculty working paper is a highly selective collection of readings and references drawn up as a guide for humanities teachers. The list, which is not definitive, is divided into three sections: Indexes, Periodicals, and Faculty Suggestions. The first two sections are annotated. Periodicals are divided into subsections by subjects, such as administration and drama. The third section, Faculty Suggestions, includes fairly recent works in criticism, history, commentary, and ideas for humanities teachers to mull over. (Author/JH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED098130

